      },
      "context": "/settings/notifications (staff session; personal settings) — Notification settings for each operator, after the admin prototype: channels with their status, an event × channel matrix with priorities (event cards with channel chips on phones), a live preview of the push and the email for the selected event, digest and quiet hours, thresholds and escalation. Changes save automatically; the island reports Saved and Test sent. Not-found is not drawn: the route always exists for a signed-in operator. · no mobile frame: the phone shows the same Saved pill under the header; the island is a desktop element"
    }
